---
import Img from '../Img.astro';
---

<div class="container">
    <section class="cta reveal">
        <Img class="cta-mascot" src="hanako-wave.webp" alt="" width={140} />
        <h2>あなたのサーバーにも、<span class="hl">はなこを。</span></h2>
        <p>使い方は、ボイスチャンネルで<code>/plz</code>と打つだけです。まずは一度、呼んでみましょう。</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#invite">無料で始める</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/Ebycow/hanako" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHubで見る ↗</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

<style>
    .cta {
        position: relative;
        margin: 120px auto 0;
        padding: 70px 30px;
        text-align: center;
        border-radius: 40px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background:
            radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 2px, transparent 2.5px) 0 0 / 26px 26px,
            linear-gradient(160deg, #ffe3ee, #ffd0e2 60%, #ffe8d9);
        border: 3px solid #fff;
        box-shadow:
            0 0 0 2px var(--pink-soft),
            0 10px 0 2px var(--pink-soft);
    }

    .cta h2 {
        font-size: clamp(28px, 4.4vw, 50px);
        line-height: 1.35;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
    }

    .cta p {
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 17px;
        margin: 0 auto 30px;
        max-width: 560px;
    }

    .cta .hero-actions {
        justify-content: center;
    }

    .cta-mascot {
        width: 140px;
        display: block;
        margin: 0 auto 10px;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 14px rgba(214, 51, 111, 0.25));
        animation: bob 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
</style>
